                                "sense_id": "61ddd3ba-ea9e-3b3b-a60c-d5ce5438d573",
                                "text": "\"The individual existence of man begins on the sense plane of the physical world, but rises through successive gradations of ethereal and celestial spheres, corresponding with his ever unfolding deific life and powers, to a destiny of unspeakable grandeur and glory."
                            },
                            {
